      "text": "County status: Complete February 2, 2026, in CEQA review.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001431"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "NOP: about 6.65-acre development area within the 16.75-acre parcel at Almaden Road and Topam Glen Court, within 1,000 feet of San Jose. Two existing homes, a barn and accessory structures would be demolished. Site designated Open Space Reserve and zoned A-20Ac-d1-sr. Plan includes private streets, two driveways from Almaden Road, a 0.8-acre onsite wastewater system, and an HOA; single-phase construction of about two years.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003535"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "NOP states the project is processed by the County under SB 330. CEQAnet lists ROEM Corporation as applicant, contact Jim Campbell, Director of Development and Entitlements. SF YIMBY reported the proposal revised from 7 to 44 market-rate units plus 6 below-market-rate units.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003535",
        "SRC-003536",
        "SRC-003537"
      ]
    }
